Portrait of a fantasy D&D character. A male halfling (hobbit-like, 3 feet tall) tavern owner in his 40s. Round face, balding on top with curly brown hair on the sides. Nervous expression, wringing his hands. Wearing a barkeep's outfit: rolled-up sleeves, leather apron, towel over one shoulder. Slightly pudgy, short even for a halfling. Background: a cozy but slightly run-down tavern interior with wooden beams, barrels, and mugs on shelves. Style: realistic fantasy portrait, warm tavern lighting, waist-up.
